    mempool: make topological consistency checking optional on every network
    
    Port BCHN04 direct-parent induction to the current ABC checker, retaining graph, coin, pointer, fee, size and cached-memory assertions. Default the mempool-specific whole-pool diagnostic to zero on regtest as on other networks; leave block-index diagnostics unchanged. Keep native and functional test checking explicit and exercise long chains, diamonds, mined parents, removal/reaccept and real reorg admission.

